==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer Cats]] such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Welterweight Cat]], or [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener Cat]] in order to win.

